(7639924, 1240064, 67145, '<td valign="top">I saw this as a thumb on my phone looking at all the photos in this challenge .. <br/>this jumped right out at me for the gorgeous colours and the title .. which I thought was a joke .. considering the beauty of the scene .. <br/>so I opened it up .. absolutely stunning image ..<br/>and the title .. perfect .. <br/>I would imagine purgatory could feel like a sinking into the depths .. altho my beliefs don''t include purgatory etc when we die .. <br/>I feel the reality is .. heaven hell and purgatory are all here .. we don''t have to die to experience them .. <br/>I haven''t seen your competition yet but this is so beautiful it must ribbon .. :)</td>', 'I saw this as a thumb on my phone looking at all the photos in this challenge .. this jumped right out at me for the gorgeous colours and the title .. which I thought was a joke .. considering the beauty of the scene .. so I opened it up .. absolutely stunning image ..and the title .. perfect .. I would imagine purgatory could feel like a sinking into the depths .. altho my beliefs don''t include purgatory etc when we die .. I feel the reality is .. heaven hell and purgatory are all here .. we don''t have to die to experience them .. I haven''t seen your competition yet but this is so beautiful it must ribbon .. :)', '2019-08-30 02:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
