(7639958, 1240424, 86447, '<td valign="top">Would be better right side up, in my opinion.<br/> <br/>Did you upload this straight from your phone or drone?<br/> <br/>This has happened to me several times.   It looks upright on my device, but it''s sideways on DPC.<br/> <br/>Anyway, I like the colors and that curvy line of the water/beach.</td>', 'Would be better right side up, in my opinion. Did you upload this straight from your phone or drone? This has happened to me several times.   It looks upright on my device, but it''s sideways on DPC. Anyway, I like the colors and that curvy line of the water/beach.', '2019-08-30 15:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7639959, 1240411, 56502, '<td valign="top">Weird! Interesting find!</td>', 'Weird! Interesting find!', '2019-08-30 15:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7639960, 1240374, 86447, '<td valign="top">I''m really liking the different "take" here... having the boat inside.<br/> <br/>Well done.</td>', 'I''m really liking the different "take" here... having the boat inside. Well done.', '2019-08-30 15:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
