(7640270, 1240378, 6804, '<td valign="top">My favorite part of this image is the sun softly defused through the clouds.  If I was forced to find one thing that might improve the shot; it would be the perspective distortion showing on the far left.  A simple fix.    Great job of shooting into the sun and adding interest to what would otherwise be a relatively ordinary image.  Nice work!</td>', 'My favorite part of this image is the sun softly defused through the clouds.  If I was forced to find one thing that might improve the shot; it would be the perspective distortion showing on the far left.  A simple fix.    Great job of shooting into the sun and adding interest to what would otherwise be a relatively ordinary image.  Nice work!', '2019-09-03 04:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7640271, 1240078, 6804, '<td valign="top">How rare!  an action sunset!   Love the colors!  great job of catching the moment!  High marks from me.</td>', 'How rare!  an action sunset!   Love the colors!  great job of catching the moment!  High marks from me.', '2019-09-03 04:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
