(7640513, 1240401, 67145, '<td valign="top">so far the second best one i''ve seen in this challenge .. but i havent seen them all yet .. !! .. <br/>loving the black and white edit and that wonderful sky .. it looks threatening .. which is quite appropriate considering your subject .. <br/>the boat looks abandoned .. certainly looks like its not going anywhere in the water anytime soon .. <br/>actually like your crop too .. going out of the frame .. like there''s hope for this poor vessel yet .. :)</td>', 'so far the second best one i''ve seen in this challenge .. but i havent seen them all yet .. !! .. loving the black and white edit and that wonderful sky .. it looks threatening .. which is quite appropriate considering your subject .. the boat looks abandoned .. certainly looks like its not going anywhere in the water anytime soon .. actually like your crop too .. going out of the frame .. like there''s hope for this poor vessel yet .. :)', '2019-09-04 23:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
