(7640516, 1240391, 67145, '<td valign="top">i hope you dont get marked down because the boat isnt something that jumps right out at you straight away .. i particularly like things that arent immediately obvious .. so this really appeals to me ..<br/>its a most beautiful scene .. the water and the sky .. just glorious .. this is a stunner of a photo .. :)</td>', 'i hope you dont get marked down because the boat isnt something that jumps right out at you straight away .. i particularly like things that arent immediately obvious .. so this really appeals to me ..its a most beautiful scene .. the water and the sky .. just glorious .. this is a stunner of a photo .. :)', '2019-09-04 23:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
