(7640533, 1240384, 6804, '<td valign="top">I think the composition, placement and subject are all right on target.  I''m not so fond of the washed out colors.  I would like to think that the muted colors are extreme enough that I''m telling myself that it must be intentional processing.  I hope that is indeed the case here.   I do think a more naturally saturated photo with perhaps a little grit/grain added might have given this a little higher score.  Right now, it looks like a calendar that has been hanging on the wall for so long the reds and yellows have faded away.  Which is a look I try to avoid.  I hope this is helpful.  Mine is just one opinion,  don''t let it keep you from greatness just the way you like it.</td>', 'I think the composition, placement and subject are all right on target.  I''m not so fond of the washed out colors.  I would like to think that the muted colors are extreme enough that I''m telling myself that it must be intentional processing.  I hope that is indeed the case here.   I do think a more naturally saturated photo with perhaps a little grit/grain added might have given this a little higher score.  Right now, it looks like a calendar that has been hanging on the wall for so long the reds and yellows have faded away.  Which is a look I try to avoid.  I hope this is helpful.  Mine is just one opinion,  don''t let it keep you from greatness just the way you like it.', '2019-09-05 00:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7640534, 1240410, 6804, '<td valign="top">If it weren''t for the title,  I would have no idea what I''m looking at here.  I''m afraid that may cost you some votes... I hope not too many.   It''s an interesting image.  Certainly "artsy"  but if you were shooting for a high score.... you may need to include just a few more details in the frame so the voters can see it is actually a row of canoes.  I am interested to see how this does in the challenge.    Good Luck!</td>', 'If it weren''t for the title,  I would have no idea what I''m looking at here.  I''m afraid that may cost you some votes... I hope not too many.   It''s an interesting image.  Certainly "artsy"  but if you were shooting for a high score.... you may need to include just a few more details in the frame so the voters can see it is actually a row of canoes.  I am interested to see how this does in the challenge.    Good Luck!', '2019-09-05 00:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7640539, 1240421, 68504, '<td valign="top">I wonder if I will have anything left to learn when I finally understand why this picture pleases me as much as it does. I mean is it merely the strong composition, the unexpected but striking mirroring of the vertical elements, left front/right rear and all the straight edged shapes between? How much depends on the man with a dog disappearing into a telephone pole, on the dog''s leash looking at once like its tail and then again (?) extending behind the man as if it were his little tail? What a wretched photograph. Thank you.</td>', 'I wonder if I will have anything left to learn when I finally understand why this picture pleases me as much as it does. I mean is it merely the strong composition, the unexpected but striking mirroring of the vertical elements, left front/right rear and all the straight edged shapes between? How much depends on the man with a dog disappearing into a telephone pole, on the dog''s leash looking at once like its tail and then again (?) extending behind the man as if it were his little tail? What a wretched photograph. Thank you.', '2019-09-05 00:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
