(7640795, 1240401, 147314, '<td valign="top">Hi Ellie, nice pic of the Corpach shipwreck. I lived in FW for 5 years so I know this place well. One thing in your little story isnt right though. It wasnt 1972 that it broke loose, but 2010 or 2011 after a heavy storm. It happened while we were living near Corpach. One day there was only the beach, next day it was there. It was moored on the opposite site of Loch Linnhe and was supposed to be restored, but clearly that has never happened.</td>', 'Hi Ellie, nice pic of the Corpach shipwreck. I lived in FW for 5 years so I know this place well. One thing in your little story isnt right though. It wasnt 1972 that it broke loose, but 2010 or 2011 after a heavy storm. It happened while we were living near Corpach. One day there was only the beach, next day it was there. It was moored on the opposite site of Loch Linnhe and was supposed to be restored, but clearly that has never happened.', '2019-09-07 08:34:32.000000', NULL, 0),
